          },
          "cycle_time": {
            "description": "`{\"per_case\": {...}, \"per_step\": {...}}` — cycle-time percentiles;\ncarried alongside variants rather than exposed as a third route,\nsince both read from the same snapshot row and the module plan's\nPhase 1 checklist does not call for a dedicated cycle-time endpoint."
